# Title: AADInternals PowerShell Cmdlets Execution - ProccessCreation
# ID: c86500e9-a645-4680-98d7-f882c70c1ea3
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Austin Songer (@austinsonger), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-12-23
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.reconnaissance, attack.discovery, attack.credential-access, attack.impact
# Description: Detects ADDInternals Cmdlet execution. A tool for administering Azure AD and Office 365. Which can be abused by threat actors to attack Azure AD or Office 365.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*Add-AADInt* OR cmdline:*ConvertTo-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Disable-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Enable-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Export-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Find-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Get-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Grant-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Initialize-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Install-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Invoke-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Join-AADInt* OR cmdline:*New-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Open-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Read-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Register-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Remove-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Reset-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Resolve-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Restore-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Save-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Search-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Send-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Set-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Start-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Unprotect-AADInt* OR cmdline:*Update-AADInt*)) AND (((process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\powershell_ise.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.Exe" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll"))))
